/**
 * Deutsch: the teaching text on the chapter-picker page of each book
 * (app/reading/books/[book]/page.tsx).
 *
 * The English is the source and stays in that page. This file is loaded with
 * a dynamic import() only when the app language is German, so English readers
 * never download it. Keys are the same lower-case English book names the page
 * uses. A missing entry shows the English.
 *
 * Voice: "du", warm and plain, the way Louis explains it. Every fact of the
 * English is kept, nothing is added. Book names follow lib/i18n/bookNames.ts
 * (1. Mose, Psalmen, Offenbarung). Where the English explains its own English
 * book title ("Genesis means beginning"), the German names that title next to
 * the Luther name so the sentence still makes sense.
 */

